            "block_content": "When the Fourth of July falls on a Saturday, Friday will be considered the holiday. When the Fourth of July falls on a Sunday, Monday will be considered the holiday. When Christmas Eve and Christmas Day, New Year's Eve and New Year's Day fall on a Friday and Saturday, Saturday and Sunday or Sunday and Monday, the Company will celebrate said holidays as follows:",
